---
title: "HackMatch — US-035: Attachment Lifecycle and Storage Cleanup — State Diagram"
---
%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"background":"#ffffff","primaryColor":"#e8f1ff","primaryTextColor":"#1f2937","primaryBorderColor":"#3b82f6","lineColor":"#4b5563","secondaryColor":"#f3e8ff","tertiaryColor":"#fff7d6","fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif"},"flowchart":{"useMaxWidth":true,"htmlLabels":true,"curve":"basis","nodeSpacing":38,"rankSpacing":50,"padding":14}}}%%
flowchart TB
    REQUEST["Upload by a PART<br/>with send access"]:::identity
    REFUSED["Refused, no row created<br/>Type, size, hourly limit,<br/>or quota"]:::denied
    UPLOADING["status 'uploading'<br/>Reserved, counts<br/>toward quota"]:::transition
    PENDING["status 'pending'<br/>Object stored, staged<br/>for the next message"]:::transition
    ATTACHED["status 'attached'<br/>Linked to one message<br/>Current readers only"]:::success
    DELETED["Row deleted<br/>Trigger queues<br/>its storage_key"]:::denied
    QUEUED["Deletion queue entry<br/>Object not downloadable"]:::internal
    REMOVED["Object removed,<br/>queue entry deleted"]:::success
    RETRY["Removal failed<br/>Retried next run"]:::warning

    REQUEST -->|"Checks fail"| REFUSED
    REQUEST -->|"Checks pass"| UPLOADING
    UPLOADING -->|"Bytes stored, row marked"| PENDING
    UPLOADING -->|"Step failed, or<br/>stuck 15 minutes"| DELETED
    PENDING -->|"Sent with text,<br/>max 5 per message"| ATTACHED
    PENDING -->|"Unsent after 24 h"| DELETED
    ATTACHED -->|"Message, channel, or<br/>account deleted"| DELETED
    DELETED --> QUEUED
    QUEUED -->|"Maintenance run"| REMOVED
    QUEUED --> RETRY
    RETRY --> QUEUED

    SCAN["scan_status is always 'not_scanned'<br/>No scanner exists, so attachments<br/>are off in production. Scanning<br/>('clean', 'infected') is deferred"]:::internal
    CASCADE["Cascades delete metadata only<br/>Maintenance (every 15 minutes<br/>and after uploads) removes bytes"]:::internal
    SCAN -.-> UPLOADING
    CASCADE -.-> DELETED

